(text "NOTES:" (at 20.32 482.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 03080b3e-25e6-540e-a452-75f33311b014))
(text "Use CHERRY MX6C-T3NB tactile switches. The five MP fixation lands connect to GND per CHERRY PCB-reference-design; pins 1/2 form the matrix." (at 20.32 490.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 205cf20f-ac4f-5303-a782-a33c0c2fffc0))
(text "D320-D384 are JSCJ 1N4148WS, SOD-323, C2128. Pin 2 is anode on KB_ROWn; pin 1 is cathode at the per-key switch node." (at 20.32 497.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 2408f636-c33d-5dda-bfca-81e645685c51))
(text "J320 mirrors mainboard J310. Fit mainboard R387 for the RGB I2C buffer; keep R386 absent so the 5 V current limit cannot be bypassed." (at 20.32 505.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid bcbd870c-25d3-5634-bcee-8e8448ec6a1d))
(text "Fit LEDs and support parts before the MX ULP switches. Follow CHERRY's assembly process and check a first article." (at 20.32 513.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 8c8cfd5c-a6ab-55a6-a9a2-baaad7160342))
(text "The split space layout is unchanged. Check the large keycaps and stabilizers with the actual switch/plate stack." (at 20.32 520.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 98408e68-8bd9-5af0-a13d-276b6cb1a1b1))
(text "Legends/keycaps are mechanical deliverables: prototype blank resin/MJF caps and clip coupons before final legends or stabilizer bars." (at 20.32 528.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid f9b9c354-4e0c-5320-85a2-dd16ad6bf356))
(text "keyboard rgb: 65 separate colours, hardware-limited current" (at 650.24 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 62c51f47-6858-5d92-926c-2061f28814a4))
(text "Everlight 19-337/R6GHBHC-C02/2T, 1.6 x 1.6 x 0.35 mm; LEDs are fitted before the switches." (at 650.24 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 863b3a3c-5315-5511-85ee-16faa6d9c40a))
(text "Physical rows use sink groups 1..5; the ten extra keys use group 6. Scan banks follow nearby columns." (at 650.24 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 0628ed16-d445-5c33-8ebd-0c1e842a7acd))
